# anchors.list — STATE-CONTRACT.md file:line citation pins (issue #36).
# One anchor per line: <relpath>:<lineno>:<keyword>; relpath is relative to
# the kit root (this plugin directory). An anchor holds only if the file
# exists, the line number is inside the file, and the keyword sits on exactly
# that line — so inserting lines above (or inside) a cited range shifts the
# keyword off its pinned line and turns the suite red.
# Keyword rules: stable, unique within its file, no leading/trailing spaces.
# Colons inside the keyword are fine (the parser splits on the first two
# colons only). Cited blank lines carry no keyword and are not listed
# (observer SKILL.md:131 is the only such line).
# Coverage: every observer SKILL.md line cited by STATE-CONTRACT.md (full
# coverage — a superset of the issue's "8 處引用"); coder/reviewer/fortify
# SKILL.md and the eng scripts are sampled (>=2 anchors each).
# Comments (# ...) and blank lines are ignored by run-tests.sh.

